That works specifically in the lungs.

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:39.780
This is very interesting.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:43.000
And again, all of this warrants more study.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:47.480
But the chloroquine treatment modalities are
being tested in more and more places.

00:04:47.480 --> 00:04:52.210
There are calls now that Seattle doctors should
start testing this protocol.

00:04:52.210 --> 00:04:54.290
They have a large cluster of cases.

00:04:54.290 --> 00:04:59.220
It would provide for some good data, but it
could also maybe help a lot of the patients

00:04:59.220 --> 00:05:00.630
