00:05:00.630 --> 00:05:02.280
So all very interesting.

00:05:02.280 --> 00:05:07.320
Lastly, we're now learning about possible
sort of genetic or underlying markers that

00:05:07.320 --> 00:05:11.410
might make people more or less susceptible
to the disease, it appears.

